---
import SiteLayout from "../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import release from "../../../data/release.json";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Roadmap — Burnished Sky Ahead"
  description="Creator-curated public roadmap for future Burnished Sky Ahead updates."
  current="roadmap"
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Community-supported, released for everyone</p>
      <h1>Roadmap</h1>
      <p class="lede">Downloads and optional community support can accelerate future free updates. Store reviews and supporter messages help inform the work; devjoe curates the final scope.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="content-grid">
      <aside>Release milestones</aside>
      <div class="prose">
        <div class="callout">
          <p><strong>Every milestone is for everyone.</strong> Reaching either target begins development; it does not promise a delivery date or grant an individual unlock, vote, or priority response.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="milestone-list">
          {release.milestones.map((milestone) => (
            <article class="milestone">
              <div class="milestone-id">{milestone.id}</div>
              <div>
                <strong>{milestone.downloads.toLocaleString("en-US")} downloads</strong><br />
                <span>or a US${milestone.supportUsd} community support target</span><br />
                <span class="status-tag">{milestone.status}</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3>{milestone.feature}</h3>
                <p>{milestone.description}</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        <h2>How decisions are made</h2>
        <p>
          devjoe sets the milestones and final scope while actively reading Store
          reviews and messages from supporters. Aggregate progress is updated
          manually. Supporter names and messages remain private unless the person
          explicitly approves publication.
        </p>
        <p>
          Support totals are measured as {release.support.progressBasis}.{" "}
          Aggregate totals are updated manually; last updated <time datetime={release.support.progressLastUpdated}>August 10, 2026</time>.
        </p>
        <p>States move from Target not reached → Target reached → In design → In testing → Released.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
